=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Nereus} (I-8) near the Proto-Waypoint to begin this quest.
* Go to I-7 (third map) in {z:Gusgen Mines}, near a pond, and click on the "Clay" to obtain {i:Gusgen Clay|Gusgen Clay|569}:
** {s:Sneak} will be useful, as there are level 85+ monsters in this area.
*** You can gain Sneak and Invisible by purchasing Circumspection from the {p:Grounds Tome} at (H-7), however only do so **after** opening the below door.
** Use the {p:Survival Guide} warp then head north.
** Run down the stairs and enter the rightmost door at (H-6). If the door is closed, use the lever to open the door; you **cannot** use the lever if you are Invisible.
** Drop down the hole in the northeastern corner of (I-6) on Map 2.
** You will find the clay near the right-most pond at (I-6/7) on Map 3.
* Bring the {i:Gusgen Clay|Gusgen Clay|569} back to {n:Nereus} to complete the quest.

=3 Notes
* You must wait 8 hours before repeating this quest.

